0080; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0Bihar BPSC Factory Inspector DV Schedule 2026 : Important Question\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When was the Bihar BPSC Factory Inspector DV Schedule 2026 released?</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The <strong data-end=\"192\" data-start=\"148\">Document Verification (DV) Schedule 2026</strong> has been released on the official BPSC website for shortlisted candidates. Candidates should download the schedule and check their reporting details.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question: How can I download the Bihar BPSC Factory Inspector DV Schedule 2026?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Visit the official BPSC website, open the <strong data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"513\">Notices/Latest Updates</strong> section, click on the <strong data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"562\">Factory Inspector DV Schedule 2026</strong> link, and download the PDF.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"fon